Subject: [PATCH 0945/3799] soh: rename func_809B2B48 -> EnAnubiceFire_Burst

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: terminal state: every other frame spawns twenty dispersed KiraKira particles and kills the actor after six bursts.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Anubice_Fire/z_en_anubice_fire.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_En_Anubice_Fire/z_en_anubice_fire.c    | 11 ++++++-----
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Anubice_Fire/z_en_anubice_fire.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Anubice_Fire/z_en_anubice_fire.c
